      ],
      "explanation": "The commitment component's comments assign it monotonically increasing commitment from voter progress and identify startIndex as the threshold required before commitment. These attributed responsibilities support the local obligation independently of the observed sorting implementation. The obligation correctly constrains advances under the current voter map and confines report monotonicity to match calls.",
