      "explanation": "The declaration at line 53 and behavior range 53–64 correctly identify setConfiguration. It rebuilds the voter map under lock, copies surviving IDs' progress, initializes absent IDs to zero and recalculates. The O_commit association and direct use are accurate. appendConfigurationEntry supplies an actual setter call, while configurationChangeChIfStable exposes relevant caller conditions; the complete transition eligibility path is still unestablished.",
